Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.25,0:02:54.75,Alt Styling,,0,0,0,,{\an8}...and are precious treasures.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.00,0:03:01.72,Alt Styling,,0,0,0,,{\an8}with us for the rest of our lives,\Nand always embrace this camaraderie.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.11,0:00:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(68.001,388.002)}I wish I could\Nwin the lottery.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.11,0:00:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(1383.999,993.999)}That girl's shoes\Nare cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.11,0:00:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(405.999,899.001)}Why won't she text me back?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.15,0:00:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1578,1028.001)\fs60}I need a boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.15,0:00:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(472.002,985.998)}I ate too much yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.07,0:00:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(387.999,1002)}Ooh, she really {\i1}does {\i0}like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.07,0:00:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1564.002,1002)}I'm so sleepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.70,0:00:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs60\pos(1358.004,1014.003)}I think my back tooth\Nis hurting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.70,0:00:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs54\pos(367.998,1017)}Hey, don't step on my feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.91,0:00:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(63.999,1024.002)}Aw, I wish I had\Nmy license.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.91,0:00:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(1353.999,1037.001)}I'm staying\Nhome tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.64,0:00:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Aww, I wish I was more popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.10,0:00:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}All right, my horoscope says I'll have\Na great day. Ah, that boy looks cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.94,0:00:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm able to read people's minds.\NOr more precisely,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.74,0:00:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear what they're thinking\Nas though they were telling a story.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.62,0:00:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything people want\Nto know is written in my blog.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to eat my fill of meat today!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.54,0:00:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I've named this power "Monologue."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.50,0:00:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But I haven't told anyone. If people\Nfound out, I'd be ostracized by them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.88,0:01:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Because no one would be comfortable\Nwith having someone else
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.26,0:01:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,knowing what they're thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.56,0:01:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I lied and told\Nthe others that my dumb parlor trick
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.23,0:01:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,of being able to stick one-yen coins\Nto my forehead was my power.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.23,0:01:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't revealed this power to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.44,0:01:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,No one else has found out about it yet,\Nnor does anyone even suspect it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.15,0:01:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I have total confidence in it.\NI mean, after all,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.57,0:01:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what everyone else is thinking!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.33,0:01:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I got here a little too early.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.32,0:01:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe that was a bit too quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.24,0:01:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But now, I'll get a little more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.08,0:02:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,After we left, we went\Naround to a few other worlds,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.87,0:02:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,and successfully finished\NMs. Aki's summer camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.46,0:02:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We had a bit of a bumpy road,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.08,0:02:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,but we must have completed what\Nshe called her "compulsory education."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.35,0:02:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We were all dismissed,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.55,0:02:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,and at the end, we were given\Nthe rank of Private 5th Class,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.93,0:02:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,and an invitation to the battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.47,0:02:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I no longer had any reason to stay\Nwith him, and was terribly bummed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.94,0:02:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, I really like Asakaze.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.49,0:02:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Our being able to finish our camp today
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.24,0:02:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,is the result of Ms. Aki's\Nintensive instruction and guidance.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.74,0:02:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,As was our rubbing elbows with\Nfriends with whom we can work hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.08,0:02:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The bonds we have fostered here\Nwill never be outdone...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.25,0:02:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I've ended up being nobody at all, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.75,0:02:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}We will carry these experiences\Nwe gained at summer camp
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.29,0:02:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The only thing I can boast over the others\Nis my perfect attendance award.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.01,0:03:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going to become of me now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.30,0:03:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been recognized by God, right?\NYou're in the elite course.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.77,0:03:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You really are awesome, Asakaze.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.85,0:03:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We're proud to have been\Nin the same class as you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.90,0:03:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.11,0:03:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Watching everyone\Nbuttering me up like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.57,0:03:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,it feels good, but at the same time,\Ndisconcerting somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.94,0:03:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The simpleton thinks he's so hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.99,0:03:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Fall on your face, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.82,0:03:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,These guys aren't being\Nentirely truthful, are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.29,0:03:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,They're just saying what\Nwould sound nice to anyone, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.42,0:03:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's okay. I'm not like you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.63,0:03:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't mean apples and oranges, either;\Nmore like the toilet bowl and its turds.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.34,0:03:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}He's on another roll today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.05,0:03:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}This is the real Asakaze,\Nthe one that only I know. His story is...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.31,0:03:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What did you think of my speech?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.23,0:03:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it was very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.02,0:04:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-You think so? I'm not\Nvery good at these things...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.23,0:04:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, she's so cute today. Pretty soon,\Nwe won't see each other anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.99,0:04:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, declare your feelings for her!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.12,0:04:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, but I'm too afraid.\NI should ask her out first—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.91,0:04:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.96,0:04:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't bear to watch that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.26,0:04:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm no different than Kaga.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.43,0:04:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Somehow, he finds me off-putting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.77,0:04:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.61,0:04:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.85,0:04:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,...you've been in touch\Nwith Nozomi recently, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.65,0:04:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, it's not like\NI'm interested in her, or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.53,0:04:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What is she doing right now?\NI sure miss her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.03,0:04:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,She can't even do anything, but I'll\Nbet she's still acting high and mighty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.45,0:04:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Asakaze is in love with Nozomi.\NEver since we first went adrift.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.91,0:04:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,She seems fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.33,0:05:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently, she's on Hateno Island\Nwith Nagara and the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.34,0:05:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,She's still there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.46,0:05:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagara! That scum.\NIt's because of what he said that...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.26,0:05:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, I need a favor from you.\NWould you help me with my work?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.60,0:05:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just looking for a chore girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.85,0:05:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,She's one of those types. I've never\Nseen anyone ask her to help them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.15,0:05:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,When she hears she can be helpful to\Nsomeone, she'll be delighted easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.15,0:05:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just wondering what path to\Ntake next. Are you sure I can help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.44,0:05:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,She must really like me. Aw, but\Nshe's not the one I want to attract.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.62,0:05:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to answer right away.\NGive it some thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.43,0:05:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.60,0:05:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,He's stubborn, and selfish,\Nand a little ill-natured.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.34,0:05:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Strange, isn't it? It stings\Na little every time I talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.06,0:05:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Even so, I like Asakaze.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.10,0:06:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since we first went adrift.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.52,0:06:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.94,0:06:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't your power at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.10,0:06:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just the way it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.11,0:06:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what you get for\Nbeing pushy, you ugly gorilla.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.61,0:06:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the chosen one here.\NLook down on {\i1}me {\i0}all this time, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.61,0:06:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't have anyone not doing what I say!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.17,0:06:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey now, this is a super-funny face\Nyou're making, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.71,0:06:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Get lost, get lost! And don't\Never enter my sight again!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.55,0:06:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,H-How mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.01,0:06:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is she with Nagara, though?\N{\i1}I'm {\i0}the one who's protecting everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.81,0:06:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Nozomi, look at {\i1}me{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.20,0:06:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not the same person I was before.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.37,0:06:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,This is so awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.79,0:06:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure she'll be thrilled\Nif I show this to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.75,0:07:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Nozomi!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.92,0:07:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave her to herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.76,0:07:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want to keep Nozomi safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.05,0:07:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,She's just going to keep\Nslowing everyone else down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.51,0:07:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really mean that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.18,0:07:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,This way, Nozomi will reevaluate me,\Nand why she turned me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.73,0:07:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,She doesn't know the real me, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.03,0:07:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be... better if\Nshe didn't go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.86,0:07:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Asakaze's unrequited love\Nmust have ended in heartbreak.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.03,0:07:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I see him being an outcast from\Nthe world someday, becoming isolated,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.62,0:07:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,and then finally landing at my feet.\NI fantasize about that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.63,0:07:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But I know that Asakaze would never\Ncome to me, because he thinks I'm ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.93,0:07:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Not unless the world changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.68,0:07:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That's something I know\Nbetter than anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.64,0:08:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,So if I can at least...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.32,0:08:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms. Aki's boobs...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.36,0:08:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,She's taking Asakaze down the wrong path.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.23,0:08:18.20,Default,,60,0,0,,{\an1}She's taking Asakaze down the\Nwrong path
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.08,0:08:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,She doesn't think of Asakaze as anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.25,0:08:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,She's only interested in his power.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.08,0:08:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, this is such a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.59,0:08:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,He should get away\Nfrom her, fast! For sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.97,0:08:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,There is currently someone who\Njeopardizes the existence of this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.01,0:08:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It is War.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.31,0:08:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you to put a stop to War.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.10,0:08:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.65,0:08:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,This is something that no one else\Nhas ever been able to accomplish.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.32,0:08:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to create\N"death" in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.24,0:08:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.83,0:09:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Because we are static people,\Nwe can't move forward any farther.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.67,0:09:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We all have nothing to do,\Nnor anything we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.95,0:09:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't know where the trains are going,\Nwhat roles we've been given,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.67,0:09:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,or even who our enemies\Nare supposed to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.01,0:09:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,All we do have here is\Na vague sense of insecurity.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.72,0:09:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not supposed to die, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.60,0:09:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,But Asakaze thinks that\Nhe can change the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.07,0:09:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He's obsessed with\N"a great task that only I can do."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.07,0:09:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm not able to change Asakaze.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.79,0:09:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Each of the three cats has\Ntheir own role that they play.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.13,0:09:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Tora places the orders,\NGen transports them,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.84,0:10:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,and Sakura copies the things\Nbeing brought from your own world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.14,0:10:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Including living things.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.40,0:10:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Sakura, make another me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.02,0:10:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's the matter? Make another—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.74,0:10:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The cats must have\Ntheir own sense of ethics.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.66,0:10:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,They know that if they\Nuse their powers recklessly,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.74,0:10:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,they will create unnecessary tragedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.28,0:10:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, so, does this mean that she is\Nthe one behind our castaway copies?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.29,0:10:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, most likely. But just as with\NNagara's creating worlds,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.71,0:10:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,she was only unconsciously involved\Nin the phenomenon happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.01,0:10:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Then what about you, Mizuho?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.22,0:10:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you been doing all this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.43,0:10:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Who, me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.39,0:10:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm... What {\i1}have{\i0}\NI been doing all this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.19,0:11:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Rajdhani didn't take into\Naccount the cats' feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.82,0:11:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe that's why he didn't pick up\Non Mizuho's own personal potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.71,0:11:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We're being held captive by a drift\Nthat has already happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.68,0:11:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Mizuho's power...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.29,0:11:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,...may have something to do\Nwith our being in stasis.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.64,0:11:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,If you had known about this at the time,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.89,0:11:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,the outcome might have\Nturned out differently.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.25,0:11:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I might go together with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.47,0:12:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been curious about something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.30,0:12:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you hated smartphones.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.68,0:12:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an}Mm-hmm, yeah, I used to.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.64,0:12:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Nozomi was the only one...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.56,0:12:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,...who treated the others\Nwithout any deceit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.49,0:12:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I follow my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.24,0:12:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's what I believe, so it's what I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.29,0:12:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe Nozomi can get Asakaze to...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.84,0:12:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Long time no see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.21,0:12:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Been waiting long?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.84,0:12:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.01,0:12:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, they're huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.23,0:12:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here, Nozomi?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.31,0:12:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it wrong if I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.60,0:12:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You're disrupting my work.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.65,0:13:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe so, but Nozomi is here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.86,0:13:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you go with Ms. Aki?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.24,0:13:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to go put down\Na bad guy to ensure world peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.08,0:13:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You really are amazing, Asakaze.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.41,0:13:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, would you bring us along with you\Nwhen you put down this bad guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.00,0:13:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.29,0:13:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'd like to see you in action.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.63,0:13:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Nozomi, you would, too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.38,0:13:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't really...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.43,0:13:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You would, too, {\i1}right{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.18,0:13:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be dangerous for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.60,0:13:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, the one\NI'm taking down is "War."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.61,0:13:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,War...?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.23,0:13:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is "War," is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.66,0:13:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That horrible woman...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.95,0:15:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy is War?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.07,0:15:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.91,0:15:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.96,0:16:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy is empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.67,0:16:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I know...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.01,0:16:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.64,0:16:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Dinner...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.27,0:16:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,...should about be ready, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.35,0:16:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.82,0:16:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter? Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.53,0:16:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been acting strange\Never since the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.91,0:16:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what? I...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.50,0:16:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,How about a short break?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.50,0:16:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This sure is a dull world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.80,0:16:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Where could War be?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.72,0:16:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you going to do\Nwhen you find War?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.47,0:16:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Why do you ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.85,0:17:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going to kill him\Nbecause he's War?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.06,0:17:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no police or military force here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.77,0:17:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone has to do it. That someone is me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.23,0:17:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't even know what War is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.07,0:17:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the big idea, creating death?\NYou think you've become God or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.16,0:17:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you even know about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.28,0:17:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Because that girl can see\Nright through all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.04,0:17:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,She has the power to\Nread other people's minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.76,0:17:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.97,0:17:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You know everything? How I feel?\NWhat I'm thinking right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.02,0:17:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.57,0:17:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Those two...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.06,0:17:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What, were they laughing at me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.99,0:17:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,There, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.37,0:18:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,When I adjust the scale,\NI can hear her voice quite well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.00,0:18:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Using my power relativistically, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.00,0:18:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.29,0:18:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.25,0:18:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are more power holdovers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.50,0:18:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm, I got them from Nagara.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.30,0:19:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,These are just perfect for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.01,0:19:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,These are just perfect for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.60,0:19:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This gorge really does seem like\Na deep wound cut into the world, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.60,0:19:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm. It coincides with\Nwhat Yamabiko said about War, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.61,0:19:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But is this War even taking place?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.57,0:19:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I was wondering that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.20,0:19:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,At the train station,\NI overheard a lot of voices,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.03,0:19:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,but none of them knew anything about War.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.72,0:19:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have to use any powers\Nto know what's in your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.68,0:19:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and mock me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.68,0:19:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Who do you think made it\Npossible for you to even be here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.52,0:19:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true even now.\NYou could at least...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.60,0:19:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want me to tell you\Nwhy I turned you down?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.27,0:19:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's because I can't respect you.\NThat's why I can't go out with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.03,0:20:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone else, including God,\Nacknowledges me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.66,0:20:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not about everyone else. It's about\Nwhat {\i1}you {\i0}decided you were worth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.33,0:20:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving. Even if I am dead,\NI can accept my own fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.33,0:20:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I could never be as strong as you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.21,0:20:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't acknowledge who I was,\Nother than the power I was given.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.26,0:20:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I could never be like you.\NMaybe that's why I kept pursuing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.43,0:20:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But then, that ends today.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.56,0:20:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, got it. Then this is goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.24,0:20:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Nozomi really was the only one\Nwho could change Asakaze.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.20,0:20:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This time, I'll be the one\Nto show you the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.00,0:20:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's put an end to this "War."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.50,0:20:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the only one who\Ncan conquer {\i1}This {\i0}World.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.75,0:21:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll admit that.\NYou were chosen by {\i1}This {\i0}World.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.64,0:21:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing but a huge\Nwound remaining here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.31,0:21:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He's spent too much time here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.60,0:21:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's put a stop to it already.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.08,0:21:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Nozomi!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.79,0:21:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.88,0:21:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't even peer that\Ndeeply into your own heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.84,0:21:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Asakaze!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.89,0:21:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't I...?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.27,0:22:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The fruit of a\Nspontaneously-occurring power...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.86,0:22:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think it's beautiful?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.45,0:22:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I knew the real Asakaze.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.75,0:22:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.51,0:22:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The right chicken is the one you ordered,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.93,0:22:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,and the left one is the one I asked for.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.68,0:22:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we really doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.85,0:22:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.19,0:22:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Mizuho didn't want to see anyone die.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.32,0:22:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's have {\i1}oyako donburi {\i0}tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.99,0:22:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The least we can do is eat her.
